Imagine London has a big playground where everyone can play. But sometimes, the grown-ups need to make rules for the playground, like "no pushing" or "share the toys."

In China, they have a big group of grown-ups called the National People's Congress. It's like a super-big group of grown-ups from all over China!

Their job is to make the rules for the whole country, just like the grown-ups making rules for the playground. They talk about what's good for everyone in China and decide what the government should do.

So, the National People's Congress is like a giant rule-making team for China! They help make sure everyone in China is safe and happy.
 [end of text]


